8. Refresh and network coordination

Refresh triggers

Support:

* App launch
* Menu opening
* Scheduled refresh
* Manual refresh
* Network recovery
* Claude credential repair
* Provider settings change

Debouncing

Multiple refresh triggers can arrive together. Use an actor to coalesce them:

app launch
+ menu opened
+ network became available
→ one OAuth request

Rate control

Recommended defaults:

* OAuth automatic refresh: every 10–15 minutes
* Menu-open refresh: only when existing result exceeds freshness threshold
* Network recovery refresh: immediate if the previous failure was network-related
* /usage: user-triggered only, with cooldown
* Status-line file: read cheaply whenever it changes or when OAuth fails

Use filesystem event observation for the status-line snapshot when practical. Do not poll the file every few seconds.

